{{!-- ═══ THREE WAYS IN — numbered editorial rows, media alternating sides ═══ --}}
<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-36">
  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] lg:items-end" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
    <h2 class="ws-display text-4xl font-bold sm:text-6xl" data-sw-text="ways_title">One site.<br />Three ways in.</h2>
    <p class="max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="ways_lead">Most platforms make you choose between code and convenience. Sitewright gives each person the surface that fits them, on the same pages.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-20 space-y-24 sm:space-y-32">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div data-sw-animation="fade-up">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4"><span class="ws-numeral text-7xl sm:text-8xl">01</span><span class="ws-index ws-ink">Developers</span></div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">You own the code.</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Every page is Handlebars, HTML, Tailwind v4 and daisyUI 5. No block tree sits between you and the markup, so what you write is what ships.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 text-base-content/80 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <li class="flex gap-2">{{sw-icon "check" "mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-accent"}} A code editor with live preview</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2">{{sw-icon "check" "mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-accent"}} 57 template helpers</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2">{{sw-icon "check" "mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-accent"}} Typed datasets, 18 field types</li>
          <li class="flex gap-2">{{sw-icon "check" "mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-accent"}} Snippets, templates and slots</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ws-browser" data-sw-parallax-translate="40,-40">
        <div class="ws-browser-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ws-browser-url">Code · pages/services</span></div>
        {{> ws-media slot="way_developer" class="rounded-none"}}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div class="ws-browser order-2 lg:order-1" data-sw-parallax-translate="40,-40">
        <div class="ws-browser-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ws-browser-url">Content · live preview</span></div>
        {{> ws-media slot="way_client" class="rounded-none"}}
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 lg:order-2" data-sw-animation="fade-up">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4"><span class="ws-numeral text-7xl sm:text-8xl">02</span><span class="ws-index ws-ink">Clients</span></div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">They edit the words, in place.</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">One attribute makes a heading, a link, an image or a background editable. Clients click it on the live preview and type. They never need to open the code, so the layout you built stays the layout you built.</p>
        <div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-base-content/10 bg-base-200/60 p-4 font-code text-sm"><span class="text-base-content/50">&lt;h1</span> <span class="ws-ink">data-sw-text</span>=<span class="text-accent">"headline"</span><span class="text-base-content/50">&gt;</span>Websites that work<span class="text-base-content/50">&lt;/h1&gt;</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div data-sw-animation="fade-up">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4"><span class="ws-numeral text-7xl sm:text-8xl">03</span><span class="ws-index ws-ink">AI agents</span></div>
        <h3 class="mt-6 font-heading text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">Agents build through MCP.</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70">Every instance serves an MCP endpoint with 82 tools. Claude and other agents write pages, upload media, preview at five breakpoints, run PageSpeed and deploy, with the same permissions as a person.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost mt-6 px-0 hover:bg-transparent" href="{{sw-url '/features/ai-agents'}}">How agents work {{sw-icon "arrow-right" "h-4 w-4"}}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="ws-browser" data-sw-parallax-translate="40,-40">
        <div class="ws-browser-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="ws-browser-url">claude · sitewright /mcp</span></div>
        {{> ws-media slot="way_agent" class="rounded-none"}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

